5.Explain in your own words the difference between encapsulation and abstraction, using examples from any social media app you use daily (like Instagram or WhatsApp).
Ans.
-Encapsulation-Hides data
-Abstraction-Hides implementation

-Encapsulation-Uses private, protected, public
-Abstraction-Uses abstract class and pure virtual function

-Encapsulation-Example: private phone number
-Abstraction-Example: upload() without showing its internal working
